  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Help 13,000 rural Tajiks with improved healthcare</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will support 13,000 residents of the remote Neknot and its three neighboring villages in the Panjakent District of Tajikistan by enhancing their access to quality healthcare. It will improve the water supply, sanitation system, and physical infrastructure, including infrastructure friendly for persons with disabilities in the village health center. The health center has been operative since 1974 with no major repair since its inception. Your generosity today can change many lives.</narrative>
  </description>
